      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoda, khala isililo ngoFaro inkosi yaseGibithe, uthi kuye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakhathaza inhliziyo zabantu abanengi nxa ngikuthumba phakathi kwezizwe, ngikusa emazweni ongawaziyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakwenza abantu abanengi bamangale ngawe, lamakhosi abo athuthumele ngenxa yakho nxa ngigweba umkhonto wami phambi kwabo; bazathuthumela isikhathi sonke, bonke babe lovalo ngokuphila kwabo mhla wosuku lokuwa kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Umkhonto wenkosi yaseBabiloni uzakukwehlela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabulala ixuku lakho ngemikhonto yamaqhawe asabeka kuzo zonke izizwe. Azakuqeda ukuziphakamisa kweGibithe, kubhubhe lalo lonke ixuku lalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabulala inyamazana zonke emanzini amanengi, kungabi khona lonyawo lomuntu oluwadungayo futhi, kungabi khona lesondo lenyamazana eliwavubayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besengisenza amanzi alo azike, lemifula yalo igeleze njengamafutha, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho ngichitha ilizwe laseGibithe, lalapho ilizwe liphundlwa konke okukilo, lalapho ngitshaya bonke abahlala kilo, bazakwazike ukuba ngiyiNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kuyisililo esizahlatshelwa; abesifazana bezizwe bazakusihlabela; bazakusihlabela ngeGibithe langalo lonke ixuku lalo, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wetshumi lambili, ngosuku lwetshumi lanhlanu lwenyanga yokuqala, ilizwi leNkosi lafika kimi lathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoda, khalela abantu bonke baseGibithe, ubehlisele elizweni elingaphansi komhlaba kulabo abehlela egodini, bona labesifazana bezizwe ezilodumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uthi kibo: Ledlula bani ngobuhle na? Yehlani, lilaliswe labangasokanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abahamba labo, kanye labo bonke abantu babo, bazakufa kanye lalabo ababulawa ngomkhonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izikhulu ezilamandla zizakhuluma ngabo labasizi babo, zisendaweni zabafileyo zithi: Sebehlile, balele abangasokanga bebulewe empini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IAsiriya likhona lapho kanye lexuku lalo lonke, lamaliba alo elihanqile inxa zonke, bonke babulawe empini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaliba abo enziwe ekutshoneni kwegodi, lexuku lalo lihanqe iliba lalo, bonke bebulewe empini, bona ababesesatshwa elizweni labaphilayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhona lapho iElamu lexuku lalo lonke lihanqe iliba lalo, bonke bebulewe empini, behlela elizweni elingaphansi komhlaba bengasokanga, bona ababesesatshwa elizweni labaphilayo, bathwele ihlazo labo kanye labo abehlela egodini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balenzela indawo yokulala phakathi kwabafileyo kanye lexuku lalo lonke, amaliba abo elihanqile, bonke bengasokanga, bebulewe empini. Ukwesabeka kwabo kwakugcwele elizweni labaphilayo, bathwala ihlazo labo kanye labo abehlela egodini, babekwa phakathi kwabafileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IMesheki leTubali zikhona lapho kanye lamaxuku azo wonke, lamaliba awo ezihanqile, bonke bengasokanga, bebulewe empini, ngoba babesesatshwa elizweni labaphilayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabayikulala lamaqhawe afa kudala ehlela endaweni yabafileyo lezikhali zawo, aqanyeliswa imikhonto yawo, lamathambo awo endlalelwa ngezihlangu zawo; ukwesabeka kwamaqhawe kwakuselizweni labaphilayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawe Faro uzabulawa, ulaliswe phakathi kwabangasokanga, labo ababuleweyo empini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IEdoma likhona lapho, kanye lamakhosi lezikhulu zalo, loba babelamandla balaliswe kanye lalabo ababuleweyo empini, belele labangasokanga labehlela phansi egodini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izikhulu zasenyakatho zikhona lapho, zonke ngoluthi lwazo, labo bonke abaseSidoni, abehlele phansi kanye labafileyo belenhloni ngenxa yokwesabeka konke abakwenza ngamandla abo; balele bangasokanga kanye labo ababuleweyo empini, bethwele ihlazo labo lalabo abehlela egodini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho uFaro ebabona, uzaziduduza ngenxa yamaxuku akhe wonke, uFaro lempi yakhe yonke, bebulewe empini, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba yena owagcwalisa ukwesabeka kwakhe elizweni labaphilayo uzabekwa phakathi kwabangasokanga kanye lalabo ababuleweyo empini, uFaro lexuku lakhe lonke, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
